e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Fetal distress requiring fast delivery.\n-  Patients with hypersensitivity, allergic response, resistance to the drugs used in this study (fentanyl, ropivacaine, lidocaine).\n-  Patients who is not possible for regional anesthesia\n-  Patients who refused to participate in this study.\n-  Patients who cannot read or understand the agreement.\n-  Patients whose weight is less than 50kg or exceeds 100kg.\n\n### Response:\n{\n"left": "Fetal distress requiring fast delivery.",\n"op": "OR",\n"right": {\n"left": "Patients with hypersensitivity, allergic response, [OR] resistance to the drugs used in this study (fentanyl, [OR] ropivacaine, [OR] lidocaine).",\n"op": "OR",\n"right": {\n"left": "Patients who is not possible for regional anesthesia",\n"op": "OR",\n"right": {\n"left": "Patients who refused to participate in this study.",\n"op": "OR",\n"right": {\n"left": "Patients who cannot read or understand the agreement.",\n"op": "OR",\n"right": {\n"left": "Patients whose weight is less than 50kg [OR] or exceeds 100kg."\n}\n}\n}\n}\n}\n}\n}<|eot_id|>']
Response: {
"left": "Fetal distress requiring fast delivery.",
"op": "OR",
"right": {
"left": "Patients with hypersensitivity, allergic response, [OR] resistance to the drugs used in this study (fentanyl, [OR] ropivacaine, [OR] lidocaine).",
"op": "OR",
"right": {
"left": "Patients who is not possible for regional anesthesia",
"op": "OR",
"right": {
"left": "Patients who refused to participate in this study.",
"op": "OR",
"right": {
"left": "Patients who cannot read or understand the agreement.",
"op": "OR",
"right": {
"left": "Patients whose weight is less than 50kg [OR] or exceeds 100kg."
}
}
}
}
}
}
}
