e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Inability to give informed consent\n-  <18 years of age\n-  Inability to understand written English language\n-  Hypertensive urgency or emergency as an admission diagnosis\n\n### Response:\n{\n"NOT": {\n"left": "Inability to give informed consent"\n}\n} OR {\n"NOT": {\n"left": "<18 years of age"\n}\n} OR {\n"NOT": {\n"left": "Inability to understand written English language"\n}\n} OR {\n"NOT": {\n"left": "Hypertensive urgency [OR] or emergency as an admission diagnosis"\n}\n}<|eot_id|>']
