e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Prior metallic device implants such as cardiac pacemakers/defibrillators or perfusion pumps that cannot be removed.\n-  Ferromagnetic implants or objects that cannot be removed such as aneurysm clips, surgical clips, prostheses, artificial hearts, valves with steel parts, metal fragments, shrapnel, tattoos near the eye, or steel implants or jewelry\n-  Body weight >450 lbs\n-  Inability to complete the telephone screener\n-  Low T-MoCA score (<20) and absence of an available legal guardian who can accompany the participant through all phases of the study.\n-  Significant behavioral or functional disability due to cognitive impairment\n\n### Response:\n{\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {\n"left": {