e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Prescription of a Narval CC mandibular advancement device\n-  Age ≥ 18 years\n-  Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data\n-  Signed and dated informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n"left": "Prescription of a Narval CC mandibular advancement device",\n"right": "AND",\n"right": {\n"left": "Age ≥ 18 years",\n"right": "AND",\n"right": {\n"left": "Ability to understand the study information and information on usage of personal data",\n"right": "AND",\n"right": {\n"left": "Signed and dated informed consent",\n"right": "raw_text"\n}\n}\n}\n}<|eot_id|>']
